OL,3,AUS Air Force says it responded to
OL,4,A'suspected drones' over RAF Lakenheath
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Air Force said it responded to
OL,7,F"suspected unauthorised drone activity"
OL,8,Fover RAF Lakenheath in Suffolk on
OL,9,FFriday evening.
OL,11,FNo personnel, aircraft or
OL,12,Finfrastructure were affected, a
OL,13,Fspokesperson for the US Air Force said.
OL,15,FIt comes after unconfirmed reports that
OL,16,Fsirens were sounded at the base, which
OL,17,Fresidents reported hearing from a
OL,18,Fnearby village.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
