OL,3,AUS Air Force says it responded to
OL,4,A'suspected drones' over RAF Lakenheath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Defence spokesperson told
OL,7,Fthe BBC it was "coordinating with all
OL,8,Frelevant parties", adding that US Air
OL,9,FForce security personnel responded to
OL,10,Fthe reports and the situation was
OL,11,Fresolved.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
