OL,3,AWhat we know about the longest US
OL,4,Anationwide flight ground stop since
OL,5,A9/11
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US Federal Aviation Administration
OL,8,Fhas lifted the longest nationwide
OL,9,Fground stop of flights since the 11
OL,10,FSeptember 2001 terrorist attacks.
OL,12,FThe FAA said Friday's stoppage, which
OL,13,Flasted more than four hours, was "due
OL,14,Fto extraordinary circumstances" from a
OL,15,Fcommunication issue affecting all air
OL,16,Ftraffic control centres.
OL,18,FHomeland Security Secretary Markwayne
OL,19,FMullin said there was no indication of
OL,20,Fan attack and that everybody was safe.
OL,22,FHere's what we know.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/38
